# Written into public/ by the release workflow before it deploys, never committed.
public/download/
public/install.sh
public/install.ps1

# The root .gitignore excludes *.png repository-wide (screenshots and generated images). The logo and the favicon
# are part of the site: a deploy replaces every asset, so if they are not committed here they vanish from the
# live site.
!public/brand/*.png
